  "description": "⭐ Tickets to&nbsp;<strong>Cutty Sark Afternoon Tea.</strong>&nbsp;Experience a unique and historic London afternoon tea directly beneath the iconic copper-clad hull of Cutty Sark, the world's sole-surviving tea clipper. Get your tickets now!<br><strong>Ticket types</strong><br> 🎫 Adult<br> 🎫 Child (4 -15)<br> 🎫 Student/Youth - Reduced (The age does not matter. The ID proof will be required.)<br><strong>Highlights</strong><br> 🍵 Indulge in an afternoon tea inside the world's last remaining tea clipper, Cutty Sark<br> 🛳️ Experience exclusive access to the 1869-built vessel, Cutty Sark, which historically shipped tea to London<br> ⏰ Enjoy a 3-hour tour of the ship with tea served at 12 pm, 1.30 pm, and 3 pm<br><strong>General Info</strong><br> 📅 Date: various dates and times available (select during purchase)<br> ⏳ Duration: 3 hours<br> 📍 Location: The Cutty Sark<br> 👤 Age requirement: All ages, children under 16 must be accompanied by an adult<br> ♿ Accessibility: Wheelchair accessible&nbsp;<br> ❗ For this event, all sales are final and tickets can’t be refunded, changed, or modified. For more information, please refer to our <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSVRJ1Z5-8gFm17oKLfc1rcA_HQk0tfJdZ8J4EOwBjPOBrfX-AvXaaGoq7vPNos-r2V4U4PxCfXUyar/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">T&amp;Cs</a><br><strong>Description</strong><br> Prepare for an extraordinary and unforgettable adventure! Picture yourself indulging in a delightful afternoon tea, surrounded by scrumptious treats, beneath the iconic copper hull of the world's sole-surviving tea clipper - the legendary Cutty Sark. Discover the splendor of this magnificent ship, either before or after your tea time, and be sure to secure your booking in advance while informing them of any dietary preferences. This rare and delectable experience is one not to be missed! Get your tickets now to&nbsp;Cutty Sark Afternoon Tea in&nbsp;London!<br>",
